#: ../../source/docs/servo-rc-setup.rst:7 4b99b005f8344d7b9496dfcef4f0a6c5
msgid ""
"The flapping fin Blimp requires for servos for movement and altitude "
"control. Therefore, four outputs on the autopilot will need to be assigned "
"to the Front,Rear, Right, and Left side servos. This is accomplished by "
"setting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` for each output connected to these servos as"
" follows:"
msgstr ""
"拍翼飞艇的运动与高度控制需要四个舵机。因此需要将飞控上四路输出分别分配给前、后、右、左四个舵机。具体做法是把每个相应输出的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数设置如下："

