msgid "ARMING SWITCH"
msgstr "解锁开关"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-rc-setup.rst:22 b5afd54abe2147b882f179bb47371f19
msgid ""
"While it is possible to use :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` = 2, to "
"allow arming and disarming via the throttle and rudder sticks, this could "
"allow accidental disarming in the air. Therefore, it is better to the use an"
" RC channel, controlled by a two or three position switch, to arm and "
"disarm. This can be accomplished by setting the RC channel's ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"to \"153\" ."
msgstr ""
"虽然可以将 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` 设为 "
"2，允许通过油门和方向舵摇杆解锁/上锁，但这样可能在空中误触发上锁。因此最好使用一个由两段或三段开关控制的 RC 通道来解锁/上锁。具体做法是把该 RC"
" 通道的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设为「153」。"
